      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et hoc incepimus quanta diligentia potuimus, auxilio sapientum eorum quos ad nos misisti.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And this we have undertaken , with all the zeal of which we are capable, and with the help of the councillors whom you have sent to us.</ab>
